# scratchpad/ used to be ignored wholesale. The gyms in it are the ONLY evidence behind most of
# the measurements CLAUDE.md quotes - and CLAUDE.md cites them by path (scratchpad/boxed_gym.mjs,
# scratchpad/sim/RESULTS.md, scratchpad/gap_gym.mjs, scratchpad/night_test.mjs,
# scratchpad/restart_bot.sh), so a fresh clone read a doc pointing at files that were not there
# and could not re-run a single number. The harnesses travel now; their OUTPUT still does not.
scratchpad/*.log
scratchpad/*.txt
scratchpad/*.json
scratchpad/*.mp4
scratchpad/*.png
data/
bots/*/corpus/
